From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anonymous <anonymous@localhost>
Date: Thu, 01 Oct 2026 22:24:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] WebAPI: write maindata and torrent list JSON directly

sync/maindata and torrents/info built their responses as QVariantMaps, then
converted every map to a QJsonObject (in Qt 6 a CBOR container, so every value
and key is copied into a growing buffer) and finally wrote the JSON text. With
thousands of torrents that conversion took most of the request time.

JsonWriter writes the same compact JSON straight from the QVariant containers.
Escaping and number formatting match QJsonDocument; only the order of keys
coming from QHash containers may differ. Value types without a fast path go
through QJsonValue::fromVariant() as before.
